		{
			description: [
				"Hello! &bThank you&r for checking out Compression."
				""
				"As you may notice there are many many &cuncompleted&r quests in Tier 1 along with the following quests being &cempty&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Compression is a &6very long-term project&r similar to GTNH. Meaning the development cycle is purely a \"more gets added per update\" forever and ever."
				""
				"Despite so little looking done, the task density past Tier 0 is very high per quest and can comfortably supply a &afew hundred hours&r of gameplay."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Any un-implemented quests contain an &3icon similar to this quest&r for consistency sake."
				""
				"If you do choose to stay for future updates, welcome! And if not, I am happy you chose to check out my project &c<3&r."
